# Unpacked greateyes SDK archives dumped at the repo root are not source.
# Anchored with a leading slash: the previous unanchored `greateyes/` matched
# cameras/greateyes/ too, which meant the camera driver and its vendored SDK
# were only in git because they had been force-added. The SDK we actually ship
# is tracked deliberately — see cameras/greateyes/sdk/VENDOR.md.
